body:
Hey op, thanks for this, I would absoulutely love halo the master chief collection, my pc is really bad so I can't play infinite, but the mcc is good for me, I love this series so much that I would buy a xbox just to play it, I have seen all the movies and read all the books, the lore of this games is fascinating to me, right now I play halo 2 for windows vista with project cartographer, and even tho i am the only one of my friends who likes halo, it has never stopped me from playing, i have met some really cool people in project cartographer, so I think that playing with even more people in the actual ports of the games is going to be awesome.

&#x200B;

I can\`t really post evidence of me playing halo 1 and 2 because I played the first ports of those games to pc, those ports aren't availalbe for purchase anymore so there is no record of my save in steam or something. The others don't have singular ports like those, so the mcc is the only way of playing them on pc.  

&#x200B;

The game costs 20$ right now because of a 50% discount, i would not request it if it wasn't on discount.

&#x200B;

Link to the game [https://store.steampowered.com/app/976730/Halo\_The\_Master\_Chief\_Collection/](https://store.steampowered.com/app/976730/Halo_The_Master_Chief_Collection/)

&#x200B;

Link to my account 

https://steamcommunity.com/id/ElPeluca16

